					<description><![CDATA[Choreographer-turned-recording artist J2X brings his hip-hop and electronic charm to Rappler Live Jam!]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p>MANILA, Philippines – J2X makes his Rappler Live Jam debut on Thursday, October 29!</p>



<p>J2X, whose real name is Jay Joseph Roncesvales first made waves in the entertainment industry as a choreographer, working with acclaimed <a href="https://www.rappler.com/people/artists/sb19-senate-pace-act-global-paths-filipino-creatives/">P-pop act SB19</a> and dance group W3 to shape their movements on stage.</p>



<p>Now, as a singer-songwriter, he blends the sounds of hip-hop and electronic music, shining best through songs like &#8220;EDEWUP&#8221; and &#8220;AKONGAPALASI.&#8221; </p>



<p>Catch J2X on Rappler Live Jam on Thursday, 8 pm, by bookmarking this page or heading to Rappler&#8217;s <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@Rappler">YouTube</a>! <strong>– Rappler.com</strong></p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
