					<description><![CDATA[Here are the November 2026 special non-working days in various localities, as proclaimed by the President
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p>MANILA, Philippines – This is a compilation of special non-working days in various localities in the Philippines for November 2026, as proclaimed by President Ferdinand Marcos Jr.</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>November 4 &#8211; Quezon Province, via <a href="https://www.officialgazette.gov.ph/2026/10/12/proclamation-no-1481-s-2026/">Proclamation No. 1481 s. 2026</a></li>



<li>November 4 &#8211; San Carlos City, Negros Occidental, via <a href="https://www.officialgazette.gov.ph/2026/10/12/proclamation-no-1482-s-2026/">Proclamation No. 1482 s. 2026</a></li>



<li>November 7 &#8211; Cuenca, Batangas, via <a href="https://www.officialgazette.gov.ph/2026/10/13/proclamation-no-1483-s-2026/">Proclamation No. 1483 s. 2026</a></li>



<li>November 9 &#8211; Eastern Samar, via <a href="https://www.officialgazette.gov.ph/2026/10/26/proclamation-no-1490-s-2026/">Proclamation No. 1490 s. 2026</a></li>



<li>November 10 &#8211; Dinas, Zamboanga del Sur, via <a href="https://www.officialgazette.gov.ph/2026/10/19/proclamation-no-1485-s-2026/">Proclamation No. 1485 s. 2026</a></li>



<li>November 12 &#8211; Gumaca, Quezon, via <a href="https://www.officialgazette.gov.ph/2026/10/19/proclamation-no-1486-s-2026/">Proclamation No. 1486 s. 2026</a></li>



<li>November 17 &#8211; Carmen, Surigao del Sur, via <a href="https://www.officialgazette.gov.ph/2026/10/19/proclamation-no-1487-s-2026/">Proclamation No. 1487 s. 2026</a></li>
</ul>



<p>Bookmark this page for possible additional announcements from Malacañang.&nbsp;<strong>– Rappler.com </strong></p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
